OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland collapse 'crushing blow'
OL,4,Afor workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Poundland worker has described the
OL,7,Ffirm falling into administration as a
OL,8,F"crushing blow" after owners failed to
OL,9,Fsecure a takeover deal.
OL,11,FAbout 11,000 jobs are at risk across
OL,12,Fthe discount chain's 600 stores and
OL,13,FWalsall-based headquarters.
OL,15,FJack Dukes, who works in IT at the
OL,16,Ffirm's head office, said staff there
OL,17,Fhad been asked to attend a meeting at
OL,18,F09:30 GMT on Thursday in the site's
OL,19,Fcustomer service centre, where he hoped
OL,20,Fto find out more but feared all roles
OL,21,Fwould be under threat.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
